# Raw data stays out of git, with one exception. The download code recreates everything except the licensed
# CRSP files and the manual FFIEC NIC downloads (see README "How to run").
data/raw/*
# Exception: KRE's daily prices (312 rows of public ETF prices) are committed, because yfinance's adjusted closes
# shift slightly on every download, which made kre_beta and R5 change between runs (audits/04_self_audit.md, C).
!data/raw/kre_daily.csv

# Secrets: never commit API keys
.env
*.key

# Python / Jupyter clutter
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Row-level CRSP data (licensed: Lehigh users only)
data/interim/

.venv/
work/
